    "biography": {
      "concept": "Circuit Rider relay technician, travelling with Captain Robot's column (Act 2-3)",
      "notes": "Simone is the Circuit Rider who can hear a machine fail before it knows it is dying, and she is usually elbow-deep in a half-cased relay rack. She is still, clipped and exact, with an unnerving calm, and counts under her breath. What she checks in people is whether they lag, because lag is where casualties breed. She will ask whether you are capable and also interruptible, and she means both as compliments."
    }
